<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 3.0050.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 3.0050.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0050 against the dollar, up from Wednesday's 3.0065 and at 1.8185 to the mark, up from 1.8200, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty flat at an average of 2.73 percent from the weighted central dollar and mark parity rates.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
